{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"x":330,"mirrow":false,"y":14,"img":"chara023_1","addImg":"chara023_1_face_chara023_1a"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":330,"mirrow":false,"y":14,"img":"chara023_1","addImg":"chara023_1_face_chara023_1a"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卡夫","text":"[show]该怎么说呢。老大这个营地比我见过的所有营地都要好。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卡夫","text":"[show]不过我是没什么见识啦，小时候跟着佣兵团到处扎营，他们只给我睡拉车的猪圈。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卡夫","text":"[show]后来到了巴诺姆村，我就住在自卫团的营房，偶尔去村里熟悉的人家里串串门。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卡夫","text":"[show]村子的建筑也比较简陋，最大的房子也就是大姐头家里了，不过里面大部分空间也是作为库房，放的村里一些物资和文件啥的。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara023_1_face_chara023_1d"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卡夫","text":"[show]像是老大这里这么惬意的住处，还真是第一次见到。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卡夫","text":"[show]老大说我也受过不少苦？哈哈。不过如今能遇到大哥大姐，过上如今的生活，我也没什么好后悔的。[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":330,"mirrow":false,"y":14,"img":"chara023_1","addImg":"chara023_1_face_chara023_1d"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"","text":"[hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"卡夫-对我们的营地感觉如何？","script":"sj_023_01"}